body:
I think the simplest improvement would be to grep for `AlreadyClosedException` and remove all catch blocks of it everywhere. It may not fix all of the problems, but it will only help.

I am concerned about the current situation but even more concerned about 5.0 which will use mmap more heavily (which is the right thing to do).

@uschindler and I worked all week on improving the safety here in lucene, too to avoid crashes (https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LUCENE-7409) which should also make things better.
